 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## smallpt (WebAssembly)
+
+The homepage renders [smallpt](http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/) client-side. The C++ source lives in `wasm/smallpt.cpp`; the compiled output in `public/smallpt/` is committed, so rebuilding is only needed after changing the C++ (requires [Emscripten](https://emscripten.org/)):
+
+```sh
+./wasm/build.sh
+```
